@startuml ConsistentListFromCache - Simplified Flow

title ConsistentListFromCache: Key Decision Points & IOPS Impact

participant "Client" as C
participant "CacheDelegator" as CD
participant "Watch Cache" as WC
participant "etcd" as E

== Standard LIST Request ==

C -> CD: LIST secrets (ResourceVersion="")
note over CD: ResourceVersion="" triggers\nConsistentRead=true

== Consistency Check Process ==

CD -> E: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
note right: **IOPS +1**\nExtra etcd query for every\nconsistent read

E --> CD: currentRV=1000

CD -> WC: notFresh(1000)?
note over WC: Check if cache RV >= 1000

alt Cache is Fresh (RV >= 1000)
    WC --> CD: false (cache is fresh)
    CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(1000)
    WC --> CD: Data from cache
    note over CD: **IOPS +0**\nServed from cache
    
else Cache is Stale (RV < 1000)
    WC --> CD: true (cache is stale)
    
    CD -> E: RequestWatchProgress()
    note right: **IOPS +1**\nForce etcd to send progress
    
    E --> WC: Progress notification
    WC -> WC: Update to latest RV
    
    CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(1000)
    
    alt Cache Catches Up in Time
        WC --> CD: Data from cache
        note over CD: **IOPS +1**\n(only the progress request)
        
    else Timeout or Error
        note over CD: TooLargeResourceVersion error
        CD -> E: GetList() - Fallback
        note right: **IOPS +1**\nDirect etcd query fallback
        E --> CD: Data from etcd
        note over CD: **Total IOPS +3**\n1. GetCurrentResourceVersion\n2. RequestWatchProgress\n3. Fallback GetList
    end
end

CD --> C: Response data

== High-Volume Scenario (Your Case) ==

note over C, E: During namespace deletion with 198K+ secrets

loop 198,000+ secret operations
    
    C -> CD: LIST/DELETE secrets
    
    alt Every LIST triggers consistency check
        CD -> E: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
        note right: **IOPS +198K**\nOne per LIST operation
        
        CD -> E: RequestWatchProgress()
        note right: **IOPS +198K**\nCache constantly behind
        
        alt Cache can't keep up (likely)
            CD -> E: Fallback GetList()
            note right: **IOPS +198K**\nFallback queries
        end
    end
    
    C -> CD: DELETE secret-N
    CD -> E: Delete secret-N
    note right: **IOPS +198K**\nActual delete operations
    
    E --> WC: Watch event (delete)
    WC -> WC: Invalidate cache
    note over WC: Cache constantly\ninvalidated
    
end

note over C, E: **Total IOPS Amplification:**\nBase: 198K delete operations\nAmplified: 198K × 3-4 = 594K-792K operations\n\n**Root Cause:**\nConsistentListFromCache + High secret volume\n+ Rapid cache invalidation = IOPS storm

@enduml 